@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Create an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Contoso",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "WIDGET-1", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 25.00 },
    { "sku": "GADGET-2", "quantity": 3, "unitPrice": 99.99 }
  ]
}

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders?skip=0&take=20

### Get one order (paste an id from the create response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Check stock for an order (needs the inventory service; see Services:inventory in appsettings.Development.json)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/availability
